    m_Localized: Team Cheer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153924
    m_Localized: 'When the warning icon appears, shout your team''s word together
      to undo the threat.

      Press [E] here to practice right now.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153925
    m_Localized: Team Word
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153926
    m_Localized: "Only the host can set the TeamCheerWord.\nReal words you'd actually
      say out loud are recognized best. (2\u201312 letters, lowercase English only)\nNo
      mic, or not being recognized? Turn on T-key cheering in Options \u2192 General,
      then press T when the warning appears."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
